@startuml
title Decorator | Student enters h during Practice words
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #40546E
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 250
hide footbox

actor Student
participant ConsoleClient as Console
participant LanguageLearningFacade as Facade
participant LessonSession as Session
participant "HintClient\nClient" as Client
participant "HintDecorator\nConcrete Decorator" as Decorator
participant "Exercise\nChoiceExercise or TypingExercise" as Wrapped
participant ProgressFacade as Progress

Student -> Console : h
Console -> Facade : revealHint()
Facade -> Session : hintUsed()
Session --> Facade : false
Facade -> Session : current()
Session --> Facade : original Exercise
Facade -> Client : addHint(original Exercise)
create Decorator
Client -> Decorator : new HintDecorator(original Exercise)
note right of Decorator : Constructor stores the wrapped Exercise.
Client --> Facade : decorated Exercise
Facade -> Session : applyHint(decorated Exercise)
note over Session
  The session now uses the wrapper for this question.
  hintUsed prevents another wrapper on repeated h.
end note
Facade -> Session : current()
Session --> Facade : decorated Exercise
Facade --> Console : decorated Exercise
Console -> Decorator : hint()
Decorator -> Wrapped : word() (delegated)
Wrapped --> Decorator : Word with translation and example
Decorator --> Console : first letter, length and example
Console --> Student : display hint

group Later, while ProgressFacade scores a correct answer
  Progress -> Decorator : accepts(answer)
  Decorator -> Wrapped : accepts(answer)
  Wrapped --> Decorator : true
  Decorator --> Progress : true
  Progress -> Decorator : reward()
  Decorator -> Wrapped : reward()
  Wrapped --> Decorator : 10
  Decorator --> Progress : min(5, 10) = 5
end
note over Progress
  The answer is saved with 5 XP.
  A wrong answer still earns 0 XP.
end note
@enduml
